  "description": "Gyul Han met Jeongro Yoon in Portugal on an unexpected night. The two of them talked, drank, and went home together and… that was that. However, five years later, it seems fate wanted the pair to meet again. Jeongro is now a chef competing in a cooking show and Gyul is one of the judges on the panel. They are able to talk about cooking, their past, and their hardships but… will they ever be able to talk about their feelings for each other? \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes seven side story chapters.*",
